Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救回我哥哥的 至死方休\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will save my brother or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是该隐的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是个诅咒 是能去除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a curse. It can be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是他们的走狗 - 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're their bitch. - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.09,Title,0,0,0,0,,《诅咒之书》是一本咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The book of the damned" is a spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来创造或解开所有诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for creating or undoing any kind of damnation there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把娜迪娅的法典拿来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me Nadya's codex,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就能破解密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll break this text right open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩的情况并没好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean is not getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果不祛除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get the mark off his arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会被吞噬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna eat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能量 已经恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grace, it's been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我哥哥找到治愈办法 我会杀死克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me a cure for my brother. Then I'll kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 萨姆 让我记起了我究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thank you, Sam, for reminding me who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定还有什么我不知道的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be something that I don't know about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我用作筹码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}something I could hold over her as a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她破解了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cracked the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想迫不得已伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to have to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:34.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.19,0:01:38.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆 没法多说 下载文件 为了迪恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,12通留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 voicemails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝车上的跟踪器显然是被解除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lojack on the Impala has clearly been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以什么线索都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a big heaping scoop of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要罗威娜马上兑现承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Rowena to hold up her end of the bargain… now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:21.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,如果她用《诅咒之书》去除了血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just if she removes the mark using "The Book of the Damned"…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which are what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩说… - 那是他猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean said… - Dean guessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐以待毙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit on our asses, do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们找到迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We find Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一阻止了该隐的 是死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that stopped Cain was death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀了迪恩吗 我可不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to kill Dean? Because I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我所知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only way I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能救我哥哥的办法就是去除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to save my brother is to cure the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道会有后果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, I know there will be consequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not you, not Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都说不出会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}not anybody can tell me what those consequences are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不会让我哥哥为了说不好的事自毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not gonna let my brother d-destroy himself on a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得救迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆的12通留言）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第23集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯·麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose McKinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离这里三英里处长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raised up about three miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母人很好 很虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice parents, god-fearin' folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还让她穿得像个妓女似的出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they let her leave the house looking like a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把真实想法说出来吧 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me what you really think, agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 治安官 是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, sheriff. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你我们这里的规矩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you how we work out here, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她是巴比伦的淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That right there could be the Whore of Babylon…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't make no difference at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在我眼里 她是好人家的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause all I see is somebody's little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该乱说话 治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel like a real jerk suggesting otherwise, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么盲目 祝你能破案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck crackin' the case with your eyes shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到过些挺糟心的案子吧 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked some pretty dark stuff in your day, haven't you, agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定留下了很深的印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've left quite a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搭档真不是省油灯 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner's a piece of work, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, ain't he, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么 鲁迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you doing here, Rudy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢死妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you know, just a thing I got for dead girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,查一群吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… just workin' a gang of fang, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not today you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to take a walk on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是 是我叫你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay, except, uh… except I called you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说有谁该别管\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, uh, if anybody's walking, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我来的 不对 是你求我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you called me? No, no. You begged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在塔斯卡卢拉萨 老莱姆镇也都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Tuscaloosa, just like Old Lyme,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道你就是在装样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we both know you're playing dress-up out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟早会害死自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's just a matter of time before you get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你听我的 别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you take that walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让真正的好猎人干活儿吧 - 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and let the real hunters do the work? - Agents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}New deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯失踪时不是单独一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose wasn't alone when she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友克丽丝托·索森也跟她在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend named Crystal Thorrson was with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽丝托依然不见踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Crystal is still awol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去跟她父母谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading over to interview the parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就别跟去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we agree you boys sit this one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生苦短 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's too short… partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你今天是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't know what crawled up your ass today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}but frankly, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我跟你弟弟问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regards to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好赶上喝茶 除非你们有别的心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time for tea… u-unless something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 有五颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five things, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,空心弹 内含能杀死女巫的药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hollow tips filled with witch-killing brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真刺激啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exciting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们步枪协会要骄傲得不能自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your NRA will be beside themselves with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再玩游戏了 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more games, Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the spell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Samuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都知道你就是在虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know that's nothing but a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理虽然破解了法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie may have cracked the codex,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我如果不在了 谁会给你解读呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but who's going to read it if I'm gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上调配原料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention handling the ingredients,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿捏剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting the measurements just right…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, either of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾花数年时间 跟大师学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}have spent years of your life studying with the greats,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握高级巫术的技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}mastering the intricacies of high witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 或许你俩真学过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But forgive me. Maybe you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的迪恩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来喝杯茶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just have a nice wee cup of tea…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这事没办成 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soiled the sheets on that one, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说说我愿接受什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about what I'll take…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}my freedom guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you can't be…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么咒语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know which spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯和克丽丝托一直是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose and Crystal were friends since…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得克丽丝托可能还有危险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you think that Crystal could still be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 麦金利太太 找到克丽丝托最快的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do, Mrs. McKinley, and the fastest way to find Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是找到杀罗斯的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to find out who did this to Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们注意到她最近行为是否有异常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice any change in her behavior recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,新交什么朋友 男朋友没有 或许喜欢上谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, new friends, a new boyfriend, maybe a crush?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯很害羞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose was…a shy girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她可能认识害死她的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…you think she might know who did this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯不仅认识那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Rose's case, she not only knew the person,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想跟那人交媾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, she was trying to have intercourse with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想查清究竟是男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm just trying to figure out whether it was a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是随便在草垛上滚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whether it was just some random roll in the hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们所知 她没有男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there were no relations that we're aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有这种事 你什么意思 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No relations at all. What the hell is this, agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在尽职 麦金利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just doing my job, Mr. McKinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说我女儿是个荡妇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By suggesting my daughter was a slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认 我这么想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll admit that thought crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我来到这里 闻到了这家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I came here, and I smelled the deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺骗 虐待 和耻辱的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the beatings and the shame that pervade this home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我不再怪罗斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? I don't blame Rose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闭嘴 - 怪不得她穿得那么浪荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You shut your face right now. - No wonder she put on that skank outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去寻求他人的认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}and went out there looking for validation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,落进了杀害她的怪物的怀中\N{\fnArial\fs30}right into the arms of the monster that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁干的 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who did this? - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽丝托 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal, she's still…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字溪那边有几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were these guys living out by Cross Creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他们在翻修那边的一栋屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}said they were rehabbing a cabin out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们就是想要个喝酒约妹子的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly, I think they just wanted a place to drink and meet girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽丝托和你姐姐认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Crystal and your sister knew these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你姐姐死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you couldn't be bothered to tell the cops that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却没跟警察说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your sister turned up dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初就是我带她们去那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sort of the one who brought them out there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「上帝所造 人类禁用」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"S-something made by God, but forbidden to man."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The forbidden fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,苹果是第一道原料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actual apple is the first ingredient?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人类所造 上帝所禁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Something made by man, but forbidden by god."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝禁止伪神 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, god forbade false idols, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.47,0:11:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,金牛犊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西不是毁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't that destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三样是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the third ingredient?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三样 不可能拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third ingredient, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大意就是 我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loosely translated… my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not impossible at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真指我的心脏 小小鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my literal heart, feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我爱的东西 咒语要我杀我所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I love, the spell calls for me to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 血祭 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A sacrifice. - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,书可以解除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book will grant freedom from the curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要有所回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wants something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就献出啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿个我爱的东西来 我肯定杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me something I love, I'll kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太想要自由了 不会心软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my freedom too much to make a fuss over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就是 我不爱任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… the problem is, I don't love anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那克劳力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:12:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意杀了他 不算是爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to kill him. Let's not call it love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone loves something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oskar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oskar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Czas na kolacje!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,波兰男孩 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polish boy. Oskar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Oskar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw oskar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早死了 是个农民的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was he? Uh, a peasant boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家人帮我度过了一段难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}his family helped me through some difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是三百年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁迪 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudy. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想告诉你是好消息 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could say it was good news, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚遇到了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bumped into Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏佩里尔查一宗吸血鬼案\N{\fnArial\fs30}working a fangbanger case in Superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩在内布拉斯加查案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's in Nebraska, w-working a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟人处得很不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not playing well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 迪恩现在状况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean's not exactly in the best place right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:12:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把具体情况发短信给我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just text me the details, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 都听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迪恩的头发 你得用这个完成咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dean's hair. You need it for the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你得帮我这个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I need you to do this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论付出什么代价 一定完成咒语 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the spell happen whatever it takes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这是雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean-o, uh, this is Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna talk, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… and come to an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出去 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back your ass out of the room, mister,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把刀留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:13:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁迪 走开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudy, walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, d… no, d-Dean-o,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,按他说的做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do what he says, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不会杀你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his insurance, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个男人样 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now man the hell up and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀他的 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I will kill him, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再废话 我就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep yappin', I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动手啊 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back up. - Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-don't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 别走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没这胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是克丽丝托吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crystal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…你本可以好好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… you could've talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽车旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就让他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就让他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就让他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你能告诉我到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can tell me what in the hell is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,按外面那女孩的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way the girl outside tells it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一位探员冲进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is one of your boys came in hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的搭档害死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}got his partner killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后像个日本武士一样把那混蛋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then went some kind of samurai on that son of a bitch over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今谁还用这招啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who summons anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't you call?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机里没有你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in my contacts list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去除迪恩的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help cure Dean of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那话怎么说的来着 我帮过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the expression I gave at the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果萨姆·温彻斯特不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'd feel a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,才试图杀我 我或许还愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Sam Winchester hadn't just tried to bloody kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕 我不接受拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid "no" is not an acceptable answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,点亮蓝眼睛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn those eyes blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开残破的小翅膀 灭了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread those broken wings and destroy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 按我的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…do it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸我 要么就求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast me, or beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳力 - 叫我国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crowley. - King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}King.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳烦您\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you… if you would…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳烦您 好心帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would be so kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这清单上的三个原料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three ingredients on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「禁果」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Forbidden fruit."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是柑橘 你个傻蛋 不是苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a quince, you dummy, not an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,金牛犊 至少是留存下来的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Golden calf"… or what's left of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「罗威娜所爱之物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Something Rowena loves"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为是你 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've thought it would've been you, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:18:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me. I've lived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:15.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宝贝给你了）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是干酪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that's queso.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queso and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小玉米卷 玉米粉蒸肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}taquitos, tamales.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我亲手做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homemade by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,肥得流油\N{\fnArial\fs30}All with the bad fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是献祭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it an offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得十分有趣的是 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I find truly fascinating, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,手艺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is that you and I both know…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前被你们温家人坑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've been burned by you Winchesters before,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然还敢召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet you still call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这次不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, but not this time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会耍诈 不会反悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No games, no second thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道它的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know what it can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力想克制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想自己抵抗它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to beat it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:21:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没招了 只剩你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no moves left… except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到还能有这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I never thought I'd see the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特也末路穷途了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester has tipped over his king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会杀你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't kill you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你胳膊上的血印是第一道诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that mark on your arm is the first curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那别管杀我了 你能去掉它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, forget killing me. Can you get rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从无到有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creatio ex nihilo…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝从虚无中创造了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}God created the earth out of nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你们主日学校的老师是这么教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or so your Sunday-school teacher would have you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:44.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,那么《创世纪》是骗人的喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, so Genesis is a lie, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有光之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before there was light,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有上帝和大天使之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before there was God and the archangels,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界并非虚无的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there wasn't nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界有黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.69,0:21:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}a horribly destructive,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无道德的力量 它被上帝和大天使击溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}amoral force that was beaten back by God and his archangels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是场可怕的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a terrible war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.27,0:22:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把黑暗锁在它无法肆虐的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}God locked the darkness away where it could do no harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他创造了一个血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he created a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印既是锁也是钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would serve as both lock and key,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将此托付给他最信任的副手 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he entrusted to his most valued lieutenant, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但血印开始产生了自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the mark began to assert its own will,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了一个诅咒 开始败坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}revealed itself as a curse, and began to corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.77,0:22:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法开始嫉妒人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer became jealous of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把路西法逐下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}God banished Lucifer to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法把血印传递给了该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer passed the mark to Cain,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.87,0:22:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他又把血印传递给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}who passed the mark to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是所说的 以一人命换天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}the proverbial finger in the dike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.99,0:22:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is just fan-friggin-tastic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I could remove the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须把它传下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only if you will share it with another.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:22:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,以保证锁不被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure that the lock remains unbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗不会被放进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the darkness remains banned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.56,0:23:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing that…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.23,0:23:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这样对任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我可以送你去别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you I could relocate you somewhere far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至不是在这星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even on this earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以继续活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you would still be alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.49,0:23:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不会再对你自己和他人构成威胁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no longer a danger to yourself or to others?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave it a shot, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 不管你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me… whatever you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做了什么 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you've done, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都去查案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I even worked a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拼尽全力 想抵住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave everything I had to beat this thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了 我看见鲁迪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw. I saw Rudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看见我干的混蛋事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you saw what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.23,0:23:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure as hell felt like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.60,0:23:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟 我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you're not. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,找支笔记下来 该道别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a pen. It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你满上 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you a refill, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.05,0:24:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.17,0:24:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long, long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.01,0:24:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一位邪恶贱人 抱歉 是邪恶女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}there once lived an evil bitch … sorry, witch …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.87,0:24:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被迫背井离乡 抛下她唯一的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was forced to flee her home and her only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.29,0:24:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她实在太坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she was, well, horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.84,0:24:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她饥肠辘辘 无家可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starving and homeless,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.49,0:24:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是向波兰的一家农民求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}she threw herself upon the mercy of a peasant Polish family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.43,0:24:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们收留了她 给她食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took her in, fed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她恢复了体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nursed her back to full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.69,0:24:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种她不曾体会过的善意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a kindness she had never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.89,0:24:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她尤其喜欢那个8岁的小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was particularly taken by their 8-year-old son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,并渐渐对他萌生爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, apparently, she grew to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.18,0:25:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只仓鼠告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hamster told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.51,0:25:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可悲的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragically…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.51,0:25:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男孩得了绝症 很快就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the boy was terminally ill and soon to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.29,0:25:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但女巫离开之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before the witch departed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.10,0:25:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了这男孩和他们一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}she gave the boy and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.69,0:25:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的也是最好的报答\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thanks that made sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用一个咒语治愈了这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She cured the boy with one spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.14,0:25:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还施了一个等他成年后才会生效的永久咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cast another that would take root once he was full-grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那个满口谎话 爱操纵人的贱人母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lying, manipulative whore mother of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.10,0:25:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了你永生 是吧 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave you immortality, didn't she…Oskar?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.29,0:25:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.10,0:25:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你现在想干什么 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you are thinking of doing, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.18,0:26:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必和他走的 你不必死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to go with him. You don't need to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.65,0:26:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么说真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我离开时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, when I left,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.95,0:26:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为唯一的办法就是我去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the only way out was my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我错了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was wrong, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? He's gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.14,0:26:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你送去外太空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna send you into outer space?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.53,0:26:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可没说外太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, well, he didn't say outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直疯了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is madness, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.52,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人问你 - 听他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's asking you. - Hear him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.08,0:26:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个困境很简单 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our conundrum is simple, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.61,0:26:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥杀不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother cannot be killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印也消不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the mark cannot be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.41,0:26:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会释放出我们无法想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not without inciting a far greater evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,更邪恶的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}than any of us have ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.42,0:26:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么邪恶力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}What evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.42,0:26:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.57,0:26:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what does it sound like?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着是好东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it sound like a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.50,0:27:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我把迪恩送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I remove Dean from the playing field,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有你 忠心耿耿 死心塌地的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're still left with you, loyal, dogged Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.77,0:27:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定不会善罢甘休\N{\fnArial\fs30}who I suspect will never rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.93,0:27:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会努力解救哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he sets his brother free …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.84,0:27:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不帮哥哥摆脱血印 绝不会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}will never rest until his brother is free of the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.45,0:27:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样一来\N{\fnArial\fs30}which simply cannot happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.97,0:27:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗也会被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}lest the darkness be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上你之前放我鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there was that time you stood me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.57,0:27:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用我的命做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You traded my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.25,0:27:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能保证我和这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to live with this thing forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远无法伤害到别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I know that I and it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.11,0:27:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意一直这样活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}will never hurt another living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.33,0:27:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.83,0:27:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这完全有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.18,0:27:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是太自私 才想不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you stop thinking about yourself for one damn minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为大局着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.73,0:27:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果能考虑大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you consider that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.39,0:28:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就能想通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this makes all the sense in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.06,0:28:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都拉长着脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.35,0:28:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈又只给你看 不让你摸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother showed you her "mustn't touch it" again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到原料了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the ingredients?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,柑橘让我欠了一个巴勒斯坦术士一个大人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quince cost me a major I.O.U. with a Palestinian warlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.42,0:28:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛犊的金块\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gold from the calf …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.59,0:28:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我下次再去约旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, let's just say I'll be hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会因有伤风化罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}under certain sexual-deviancy laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.32,0:28:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被绞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I ever show my face in Jordan again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the third?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.98,0:28:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.81,0:28:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我漫长的一生中 我都在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my long life, I wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我究竟做了什么会让母亲不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I'd done to deserve a mother who refused to show love.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.99,0:28:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为此痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pained over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.65,0:28:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此建立了自己的王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built my bloody kingdom on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.73,0:28:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天 我醍醐灌顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day, epiphany struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.79,0:29:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲根本不会爱任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was incapable of loving anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.45,0:29:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年来头一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in hundreds of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.50,0:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt free.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.56,0:29:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你出现在我的地牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you showed up in my dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}we communed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始意识到你并非不能去爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I began to realize you weren't incapable of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.79,0:29:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不能爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're incapable of loving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.60,0:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 费格斯 演技省省上台发挥吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness, Fergus, save it for the stage, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.21,0:29:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, fabulous speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.82,0:29:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你把自己放在了过高的地位上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you put yourself on far too high a pedestal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 我的确不 以后也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact remains I do not, will not,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.26,0:29:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前也从没爱过任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have not loved anything ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:30:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们在那教堂里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we were in that church,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.14,0:30:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复克劳力的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}making Crowley human,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}about to close the gates of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.21,0:30:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时可准备好牺牲小我拯救世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you sure as hell were ready to die for the greater good then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.77,0:30:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 迪恩 是你把我拉了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and, Dean, you pulled me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.04,0:30:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.69,0:30:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道 这个世界没有我们会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that this world would be better without us in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在曲解我的话 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're twisting my words here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.05,0:30:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 因为我们追踪邪恶并杀之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because we … we track evil and kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.37,0:30:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族事业 是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好回想一下吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the tape, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.39,0:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是邪恶跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil tracks us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.77,0:30:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶摧毁我们身边的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it nukes everything in our vicinity …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.22,0:30:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家人 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our family, our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.85,0:30:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该找准自己的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we put a proper name to what we really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.87,0:30:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,并接受它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们虽然远称不上完美 但我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're far from perfect, but we are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.38,0:30:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手臂上的东西是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing on your arm is evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.21,0:31:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not you, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害死了鲁迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Rudy die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么不邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was that not evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.31,0:31:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己是什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.21,0:31:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who were you when you …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.95,0:31:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车送那男人去出卖灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you drove that man to sell his soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.46,0:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还威逼查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}or when you bullied Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.90,0:31:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,害她被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}into getting herself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.17,0:31:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.09,0:31:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a good end?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.10,0:31:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义的结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A just end?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.87,0:31:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜代价去除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}To remove the mark no matter what the consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这怎么不邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, how is that not evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.94,0:31:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手臂上有这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this thing on my arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就愿意让黑暗入侵世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're willing to let the darkness into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.95,0:31:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还甘愿召唤死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were also willing to summon death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保你再也不能伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure you could never do any more harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我来 是因为你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You summoned me because you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.29,0:31:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护你 我什么都会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do anything to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.79,0:31:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是邪恶 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not evil, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是邪恶的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an evil man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:32:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个好人 渴望被听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a good man crying to be heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.40,0:32:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在寻找 其他的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching for… some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.18,0:32:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有其他办法 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there is no other way, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.93,0:32:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.63,0:32:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.28,0:32:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.49,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱这个男人吗 罗威娜 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love this man? Rowena, is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.23,0:32:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.09,0:32:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打招呼吧 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello, Oskar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.23,0:32:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.16,0:32:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是你 费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for you, Fergus,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是新下限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a new low …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.89,0:32:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,残忍 可耻 令人厌恶的新下限\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cruel, shameful, disgusting low.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要真下手了才叫残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only cruel if you actually go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.35,0:32:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但到了那时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.40,0:32:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁才是残忍的那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's the cruel one then?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.82,0:33:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.51,0:33:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. Hey, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.12,0:33:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远永远不会听到我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never, ever hear me say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你 真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you … the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.98,0:33:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is anything but good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.02,0:34:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.63,0:34:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你还没伤害到…其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you hurt… anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.52,0:34:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,得不惜一切代价阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to be stopped at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.13,0:34:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.94,0:35:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.84,0:35:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.55,0:35:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.78,0:35:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.09,0:35:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.95,0:35:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你找到了回家的路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you find your way back…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这些指引你\N{\fnArial\fs30}let these be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会帮你记起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they can help you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.89,0:35:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,善是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what it was to be good…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.57,0:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what it was to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了家人 你也必须动手 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for family you must proceed, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.61,0:36:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在这个样子 你变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be what you are, to become what you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.03,0:36:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会玷污他们的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a stain on their memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.38,0:36:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.26,0:36:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都长这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.15,0:37:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望还能给你老罗威娜阿姨一个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too big to give your old auntie Rowena a hug I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我没伤到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope I haven't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.99,0:37:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think about that one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine, Oskar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.03,0:37:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.65,0:37:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没谁会伤害谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's hurting anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 我亲爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, my sweet wee boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.82,0:37:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.54,0:37:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.61,0:38:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.81,0:38:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我刚刚杀了死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just killed Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.34,0:38:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.74,0:38:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.82,0:38:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那听起来正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound right to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.70,0:39:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.20,0:39:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.71,0:39:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.30,0:39:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没这个力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not powerful enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.72,0:39:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.92,0:39:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制一个无聊的国王和一个乱来的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control the likes of a bored king and a wayward angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.41,0:39:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.89,0:39:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯 恐怕在你漫长的一生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid, Fergus, that in all your long life,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.41,0:39:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见识过一个真有法力的真女巫的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've never seen what a real witch can do with real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.52,0:39:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terrifically pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是你看见的最后一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the last thing you'll ever see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.34,0:39:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.48,0:39:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.82,0:39:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.62,0:39:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.03,0:39:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.38,0:39:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这样挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.32,0:39:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手臂上的血印没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The … the mark is off your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.18,0:40:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing crazy happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.66,0:40:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿回了你的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your baby back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.35,0:40:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.23,0:40:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定一切都好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure everything's perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.47,0:40:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.26,0:40:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神怎么说的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Death call this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上车 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in the car. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.10,0:41:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.42,0:41:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.50,0:41:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
